00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.540
We would like to hear
Dr. Teru Lo-Wu's opinion!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.040
Who are you infidels?!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:28.160
The operation is proceeding
according to plan.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:32.410
We cannot realize Mother's ideals
if we act weak-kneed!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:32.950
Wh-what?!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.370
