has ever told me that, but...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.370
You northerners...

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.040
There is no going back.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.500
Huh? What's that?!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.620
Huh...?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.790
We recovered the system.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:29.830
The Program Division is currently
quarantining and revising the system,

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.540
Oh, jeez! She's so hasty.
