00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.500
Now I can go back...

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.790
...to where that hand is.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.830
I can go back, so why?

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.500
My feet feel heavy.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.750
Good evening!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:00.120
Today we are featuring
the Christmas treats in Ginza.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.540
Here is the first thing
I would like to show you!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.870
Haruka...
Here is the first thing
I would like to show you!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.830
Please take a look.
Aren't these lights beautiful?

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.910
They're all sparkly.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.080
They seem really romantic somehow.

