00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.700
"Could you be looking for this?"

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.410
Or something!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.000
I found it on the ground
in front of the dorm.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.750
This is payback for then.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.080
Haruka?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:46.750
