We didn't have anything like this
out in the country where I lived.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.200
What should I do? I have to go, but...

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.540
Why is it so...?

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.750
Hey, Yukiho.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:07.290
I've been thinking this a lot lately.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.620
"What would I do
if I didn't have Yukiho around?"

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.950
I met you shortly after
setting out to come here.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:20.120
And then I met Imber and
became an Idolmaster.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.870
Lately I've even been doing idol work
together with Yayoi.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:29.870
I think everything would have been too
much for me if it weren't for you, Yukiho.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.290
That's not true. I mean, I...

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:38.000
That's right, I...

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:43.370
