00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.660
What should I do?

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:53.000
What should I do? I don't want to leave her.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:56.870
She's my first... She's my very first friend.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.200
Hey!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.370
Everyone's waiting,
so why don't we get going?

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:10.830
Her hand is just like back then.
If I grab that hand...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.540
Wow! What is this?

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:21.660
I never dreamed I'd see snow in Tokyo.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:53.080
That's right. My greatest wish is...

